<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIXING.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIXING.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>mixed at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate was steady at 3.32 percent.</p>
<p>					Sept 13 fix	    Sept 12 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.24 pct		3.24 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.27 pct		3.27 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.32 pct		3.32 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.46 pct		3.47 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.59 pct		3.60 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.70 pct		3.71 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
